[length:05:51]
[ti:I don't feel anything]
[ar:Aracne]
[al:Chaotic-dysfuntional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne ]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.3]
[00:07.98]I don’t feel anything…
[00:12.53]Not the fire.
[00:14.13] Not the rope.
[00:16.14] Not the future
[00:18.66] halfway down the hall.
[00:42.98]I kept the scented letters
[00:46.10] underneath my bed
[00:48.45] little paper heavens
[00:51.45] yellow at the edge
[00:53.78]I had a stuffed elephant
[00:56.57] guarding every dream
[00:59.34] I don’t know where he’s sleeping now
[01:01.77] but he’s watching over me
[01:04.99]The wallpaper was breathing
[01:07.10] the room was standing still
[01:10.32] I waited for the doorway
[01:12.60] but the doorway never will
[01:15.32]No sirens, no warning
[01:17.57] no beautiful goodbye
[01:20.35] just a quiet little ending
[01:23.09] where I didn’t even cry
[01:26.12]Maybe it was mercy
[01:28.79] maybe it was fear
[01:31.15] when the heart leaves the table
[01:33.45] and the body stays here
[01:36.31]I don’t feel anything
[01:38.17] but somehow I’m alive
[01:40.94] I don’t feel anything
[01:43.44] but somehow I dont die
[01:47.87]No golden ticket
[01:49.84] no hope in the room
[01:52.35] no hand from heaven
[01:54.45] pulling me through
[01:56.90]I don’t feel anything
[01:59.28] I don’t feel anything
[02:01.88] I don’t feel anything
[02:05.21] but somehow
[02:07.68] I’m alive
[02:11.25]Alive…
[02:13.62] alive…
[02:16.28] alive…
[02:19.16]There’s a girl in static
[02:21.12] with a ribbon in her hair
[02:23.55] hugging that old elephant
[02:26.55] like someone still was there
[02:28.73]She wrote her name in glitter
[02:31.40] she folded up the sky
[02:34.05] she thought the world would answer
[02:36.22] if she learned to shine
[02:39.63]Now the dreams come back like echoes
[02:42.20] from a house I cannot find
[02:44.70] and I wake up with their perfume
[02:47.43] rotting in my mind
[02:50.45]No sirens, no warning
[02:52.90] no cinematic rain
[02:55.48] just the ordinary horror
[02:58.15] of outliving the pain
[03:01.50]Maybe I am empty
[03:03.62] maybe I am clean
[03:06.07] maybe this is what is left
[03:08.50] of the girl inside the dream
[03:10.99]I don’t feel anything
[03:13.34] but somehow I’m alive
[03:15.84] I don’t feel anything
[03:18.35] but somehow I’m alive
[03:22.17]No golden ticket
[03:24.07] no perfume in the room
[03:27.29] no hand from heaven
[03:29.35] pulling me through
[03:31.77]I don’t feel anything
[03:34.22] I don’t feel anything
[03:36.82] I don’t feel anything
[03:39.87] but somehow
[03:42.66] I’m alive
[03:47.83]Not the girl with the elephant
[03:50.30] not the letters in bloom
[03:52.90] not the beaded ceiling
[03:55.46] not the promised room
[03:58.15]Not the soft little future
[04:00.87] with the ribbon untied
[04:03.49] not the dream that kept singing
[04:06.00] from the wrong side
[04:08.11]NOT MY FUTURE!
[04:17.00]But it’s mine now.
[04:23.73]I don’t need to love it
[04:25.66] I don’t need to shine
[04:27.79] I can hold the empty shape
[04:29.98] and still call it mine
[04:32.85]Leave the red curtains hanging
[04:35.47] let the mirrors stare
[04:38.40] I can hate the life I got
[04:40.37] and still be breathing there
[04:46.06]I don’t feel anything
[04:48.19] but somehow I’m alive
[04:50.72] I don’t feel anything
[04:53.45] but somehow I dont die
[04:56.89]No golden ticket
[04:58.91] no perfume in the room
[05:02.17] no hand from heaven
[05:04.40] pulling me through
[05:06.59]I don’t feel anything
[05:09.31] but somehow I’m alive
[05:12.16] I don’t feel anything
[05:14.57] but somehow 
[05:17.59]I’m alive
[05:19.22]Not my future
[05:22.15] but I’m alive
[05:24.12] not my future
[05:27.05] but I’m alive
[05:33.28]I don’t feel anything…
[05:37.32]Where is my elephant?
[05:40.09]Still breathing.
[05:41.54] Still empty.
[05:44.04] Still alive.
